-/* ============================================================
-   parallax.js — virtual-scroll frame scrubber
-
-   The document does NOT scroll. We intercept wheel / touch /
-   keyboard input and convert it into a 0..1 virtualProgress
-   that drives the frame index and the scene fades.
-   ============================================================ */
