-    }
-    
-    PRODUCT {
-        string id PK
-        string name
-        decimal price
-    }
-    
-    LINE_ITEM {
-        string id PK
-        string order_id FK
-        string product_id FK
-        int quantity
-    }
-```
-
-### ER Diagram Cardinality
-```
-||--||   One to one
-||--o{   One to zero or more
-||--|{   One to one or more
-}o--o{   Zero or more to zero or more
-```
