-## Styling
-
-```mermaid
-flowchart LR
-    A[Start]:::green --> B[Process]:::blue --> C[End]:::red
-    
-    classDef green fill:#22c55e,color:#fff
-    classDef blue fill:#3b82f6,color:#fff
