-## Volumes (Persistent Storage)
-
-```bash
-# Create volume
-railway volume create my-data
-
-# Mount in service
-railway volume attach my-data:/app/data
-```
-
-In code:
-```javascript
-// Data persists across deploys
-const dataPath = '/app/data';
-fs.writeFileSync(`${dataPath}/file.json`, JSON.stringify(data));
