-- **Top tier (orchestrator):** `yuv-pilot`. Routes intent.
-- **Middle tier (opinionated YUV.AI skills):** `yuv-decks`, `yuv-design-system`, `yuv-viral-video`. Each owns one mode of output. Each calls down to the bottom tier.
