-- **Yellow (accent):** `#FFE61E` (video) / `#E5FF00` (web) — emphasis tokens, marker highlights
-- **Off-white:** `#F5F0E1` (video, warmer) / `#FAFAF7` (web)
-- **Stage black:** `#0c0e16` (warm near-black, never `#000`)
